---
// Shelves (#/shelves): every list of books Thorp reads, keeps or drafts (thorp.shelves.payload,
// /api/shelves, served warm): the training shelves first, then the decks it is scored on, the probes,
// the rest, and the drafts folded away. A row opens to the runs that use it and its books, each one
// opening in the reader. UI.md, "Shelves".
---
<div class="section" id="shelves">
  <h1>Shelves <span class="q">every list of books Thorp reads from, is scored on or is drafting: how many books are fetched, about how many tokens they hold, their language families, and the runs that read them</span></h1>
  <section class="panel" id="fitoutpanel">
    <h2>Fitouts <span class="note">a fitout is the training material matched to the stages it is read in: pretraining (its stages in order, one run) and post-training (its stages in order, each seeded from the one before, with its own learning rate and tack). Each stage is a block sized by its tokens, its shelf one click away below</span></h2>
    <div id="fitouts"><div class="empty">reading the fitouts…</div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="handtools"><span class="note">show</span><select id="shelfkind"><option value="">every kind</option></select><input id="shelfsearch" type="search" placeholder="find a shelf" /><span class="note" id="shelfcount"></span></div>
  <div id="shelfgroups"><div class="empty">reading the shelves…</div></div>
</div>
